WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:08.251
This page separates verification, assurance, infrastructure and professional services, so you can see what each fee covers.

2
00:00:08.201 --> 00:00:14.477
Prices depend on the scope and the evidence work required, never on whether the conclusion is favourable.

3
00:00:14.477 --> 00:00:21.261
Use the calculator to estimate a base fee by selecting sites, annual batches and optional services.

4
00:00:21.261 --> 00:00:26.105
The result excludes VAT, travel and separately scoped products.

5
00:00:26.105 --> 00:00:30.857
Standard engagements are paid half on signature and half on issuance.

6
00:00:30.857 --> 00:00:36.808
If work ends in refusal, billing covers time worked, not a missing conclusion.

7
00:00:36.808 --> 00:00:41.066
A signed quote confirms the final scope and any changes.
